# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:463
msgid ""
"**Subtle “home video”**: ``tracking=0.25``, ``bleed=0.20``, "
"``softness=0.20``, ``noise=0.25``, ``stripe=0.10``, ``static_bands=0.05``."
msgstr ""
"**Suptilan “kućni video”**: ``tracking=0.25``, ``bleed=0.20``, "
"``softness=0.20``, ``noise=0.25``, ``stripe=0.10``, ``static_bands=0.05``."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:464
msgid ""
"**Bad tracking / head clog**: ``tracking=0.8–1.0``, ``stripe=0.6–0.9``, "
"``noise=0.6–0.8``, ``static_bands=0.4–0.6``, ``softness<=0.2``, and set "
"``bleed`` to about 0.3."
msgstr ""
"**Loš tracking / začepljenje glave**: ``tracking=0.8–1.0``, "
"``stripe=0.6–0.9``, ``noise=0.6–0.8``, ``static_bands=0.4–0.6``, "
"``softness<=0.2``, i postavite ``bleed`` na oko 0.3."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:465
msgid ""
"**Color fringing only**: raise ``bleed`` (about 0.5) and keep other controls"
" low."
msgstr ""
"**Samo obrub boje**: povećajte ``bleed`` (oko 0.5) i ostale kontrole držite "
"niskima."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:466
msgid ""
"**Different but repeatable snow**: leave the effect ID alone (for "
"deterministic output) and change ``seed_offset`` to get a new, still-"
"repeatable pattern."
msgstr ""
"**Drugačiji, ali ponovljiv snijeg**: ostavite ID efekta nepromijenjenim (za "
"deterministički izlaz) i promijenite ``seed_offset`` da dobijete novi, ali i"
" dalje ponovljiv uzorak."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:470
msgid ""
"The Alpha Mask / Wipe Transition effect leverages a grayscale mask to create"
" a dynamic transition between two images or video clips. In this effect, the"
" light areas of the mask reveal the new image, while the dark areas conceal "
"it, allowing for creative and custom transitions that go beyond standard "
"fade or wipe techniques. This effect only affects the image, and not the "
"audio track."
msgstr ""
"Efekt Alpha Mask / Wipe Transition koristi masku u nijansama sive za "
"stvaranje dinamičnog prijelaza između dvije slike ili video isječka. U ovom "
"efektu, svijetla područja maske otkrivaju novu sliku, dok tamna područja "
"skrivaju, omogućujući kreativne i prilagođene prijelaze koji nadilaze "
"standardne tehnike izblijedjenja ili brisanja. Ovaj efekt utječe samo na "
"sliku, a ne na audio zapis."

