#: ../doc/effects.rst:532
msgid ""
"The **Beat Sync** effect turns audio energy into a flashing full-frame color"
" layer. A simple example is a black frame that flashes toward white on each "
"drum hit. By placing that flashing clip above your video and changing its "
":guilabel:`Composite (Blend Mode)`, you can make the video underneath pulse,"
" brighten, darken, or color-shift with the beat."
msgstr ""
"Efekt **Beat Sync** pretvara audio energiju u treptajući sloj boje preko "
"cijelog okvira. Jednostavan primjer je crni okvir koji treperi prema bijelom"
" pri svakom udarcu bubnja. Postavljanjem tog treptajućeg isječka iznad vašeg"
" videa i promjenom njegovog :guilabel:`Composite (Blend Mode)`, možete "
"učiniti da video ispod pulsira, posvijetli, potamni ili promijeni boju u "
"ritmu."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:537
msgid ""
"This effect is a little different from most video effects: it does not "
"directly brighten the clip underneath it. Instead, it creates a new flashing"
" image from the audio clip it is applied to. You preview that flashing image"
" first, then use the clip's composite mode to blend it with another clip on "
"a lower track."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj efekt je malo drugačiji od većine video efekata: ne posvjetljuje "
"izravno isječak ispod sebe. Umjesto toga, stvara novu treptajuću sliku iz "
"audio isječka na koji je primijenjen. Prvo pregledavate tu treptajuću sliku,"
" a zatim koristite način kompozicije isječka da je pomiješate s drugim "
"isječkom na nižoj traci."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:543
msgid ""
"Beat Sync needs access to audio samples. If the clip's :guilabel:`Enable "
"Audio` property is set manually, use :guilabel:`Auto` or :guilabel:`Yes`. If"
" you want Beat Sync to react to an audio clip but you do **not** want to "
"hear that clip, set the clip's :guilabel:`Volume` keyframe to ``0.0``. The "
"effect can still use the silent audio data to generate the flashing colors."
msgstr ""
"Beat Sync treba pristup audio uzorcima. Ako je svojstvo :guilabel:`Enable "
"Audio` isječka postavljeno ručno, koristite :guilabel:`Auto` ili "
":guilabel:`Yes`. Ako želite da Beat Sync reagira na audio isječak, ali ne "
"želite čuti taj isječak, postavite ključni kadar :guilabel:`Volume` isječka "
"na ``0.0``. Efekt i dalje može koristiti tihi audio podatak za generiranje "
"treptajućih boja."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:549
msgid "Basic Workflow"
msgstr "Osnovni tijek rada"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:551
msgid "Place an audio clip on the Timeline."
msgstr "Postavite audio isječak na vremensku liniju."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:552
msgid ""
"Drag the :guilabel:`Beat Sync` effect from the **Effects** panel onto that "
"audio clip."
msgstr ""
"Povucite efekt :guilabel:`Beat Sync` iz panela **Effects** na taj audio "
"isječak."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:553
msgid ""
"Preview the clip by itself first. You should see a flashing color layer, "
"usually black flashing toward white."
msgstr ""
"Prvo pregledajte isječak samostalno. Trebali biste vidjeti trepereći sloj "
"boje, obično crni koji treperi prema bijeloj."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:555
msgid ""
"Adjust :guilabel:`Low Color` and :guilabel:`High Color`. For example, black "
"to white creates a brightness flash, white to black creates a darkening "
"flash, and red to green creates a color pulse."
msgstr ""
"Podesite :guilabel:`Low Color` i :guilabel:`High Color`. Na primjer, crna do"
" bijele stvara bljesak svjetline, bijela do crne stvara zatamnjenje, a "
"crvena do zelene stvara puls boje."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:557
msgid ""
"Adjust :guilabel:`Response Curve` to control how easily the flash appears:"
msgstr ""
"Podesite :guilabel:`Response Curve` za kontrolu koliko lako se bljesak "
"pojavljuje:"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:559
msgid ""
"Lift the middle of the curve to make smaller sounds flash more strongly."
msgstr "Podignite sredinu krivulje da bi manji zvukovi jače bljeskali."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:560
msgid "Lower the middle of the curve to make only stronger beats flash."
msgstr "Spustite sredinu krivulje da bi bljeskali samo jači udarci."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:561
msgid "Create a steeper curve for a sharper strobe-like response."
msgstr "Stvorite strmiju krivulju za oštriji stroboskopski odgovor."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:563
msgid ""
"If the effect is reacting to the wrong part of the sound, adjust "
":guilabel:`Low Frequency` and :guilabel:`High Frequency`. For example, a "
"bass-only flash should use a lower frequency range."
msgstr ""
"Ako efekt reagira na pogrešan dio zvuka, podesite :guilabel:`Low Frequency` "
"i :guilabel:`High Frequency`. Na primjer, bljesak samo basa treba koristiti "
"niži frekvencijski raspon."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:565
msgid ""
"When the flashing layer feels right, select the Beat Sync clip and change "
"its :guilabel:`Composite (Blend Mode)` property. Try modes such as "
":guilabel:`Screen`, :guilabel:`Overlay`, :guilabel:`Multiply`, or "
":guilabel:`Color Dodge`, depending on the look you want."
msgstr ""
"Kad sloj bljeskanja izgleda dobro, odaberite Beat Sync isječak i promijenite"
" njegovu svojstvo :guilabel:`Composite (Blend Mode)`. Isprobajte načine "
"poput :guilabel:`Screen`, :guilabel:`Overlay`, :guilabel:`Multiply` ili "
":guilabel:`Color Dodge`, ovisno o željenom izgledu."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:569
msgid ""
"Place the video you want to affect on the track **below** the Beat Sync "
"clip."
msgstr ""
"Postavite video koji želite utjecati na stazu **ispod** Beat Sync isječka."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:570
msgid ""
"Preview the composited result and fine-tune the colors, curve, intensity, "
"threshold, or composite mode."
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte složeni rezultat i fino podesite boje, krivulju, intenzitet, "
"prag ili način složenosti."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:573
msgid "Common Uses"
msgstr "Uobičajene upotrebe"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:575
msgid ""
"**Music video flashes**: Flash white or bright colors on snare hits, kicks, "
"or strong beats."
msgstr ""
"**Bljeskovi glazbenih videa**: Bljeskajte bijelo ili jarke boje na udarce "
"snarea, kickove ili jake udarce."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:576
msgid ""
"**Bass pulses**: Use a low frequency range so the image reacts mostly to "
"bass drums or bass lines."
msgstr ""
"**Pulsovi basa**: Koristite niski frekvencijski raspon tako da slika reagira"
" uglavnom na bas bubnjeve ili bas linije."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:577
msgid ""
"**Silent driver track**: Use a muted audio clip only as the control signal "
"for the visual flash."
msgstr ""
"**Tihi upravljački zapis**: Koristite samo utišani audio isječak kao "
"kontrolni signal za vizualni bljesak."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:578
msgid ""
"**Color rhythm effects**: Blend between two custom colors, such as blue to "
"yellow or red to green."
msgstr ""
"**Efekti ritma boja**: Miješajte između dvije prilagođene boje, poput plave "
"u žutu ili crvene u zelenu."

